{%- comment -%}
  fye-pdx-assure: the four reassurance tiles on the redesigned product page
  (CRO handoff, 27/09/2026). Rendered by fye-pdx-ring and fye-pdx-stone.

  Beside the thumbnails on desktop, after the delivery block on a phone. The
  page grid moves the ONE copy; it is never rendered twice.

  Copy is the handoff's, and every claim on it is one FYE already makes
  elsewhere: free insured UK delivery, a complimentary resize in the first
  year (W399), handmade to order, UK hallmarked.

  Full eternity rings swap the resize tile for the sizer, because they
  cannot be resized. Loose stones get their own four.

  Parameters: kind: 'ring' (default) | 'full-eternity' | 'stone';
              cert: the lab name, stones only ("IGI" gives "IGI certified")
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  case kind
    when 'stone'
      assign cert_title = 'Certified'
      if cert != blank
        assign cert_title = cert | append: ' certified'
      endif
      assign rows = 'shipping|Free insured delivery|Fully tracked across the UK~doc|' | append: cert_title | append: '|Certificate supplied~ethical|Responsibly sourced|Traceable origin~ring|Set it with us|Handmade settings in the UK'
    when 'full-eternity'
      assign rows = "shipping|Free insured delivery|Fully tracked across the UK~refresh|Free ring sizer|Size carefully: full eternity rings cannot be resized~hand|Handmade to order|Crafted for you in the UK~certificate|UK hallmarked|With certificate of authenticity"
    else
      assign rows = "shipping|Free insured delivery|Fully tracked across the UK~refresh|Free resize, first year|If the fit isn't right, we'll adjust it~hand|Handmade to order|Crafted for you in the UK~certificate|UK hallmarked|With certificate of authenticity"
  endcase
  assign tiles = rows | split: '~'
-%}
<ul class="pdx__assure">
  {%- for tile in tiles -%}
    {%- assign bits = tile | split: '|' -%}
    <li class="pdx__assuretile">
      {%- render 'icon', name: bits[0], size: 22 -%}
      <span class="pdx__assuretxt">
        <span class="pdx__assuretitle">{{ bits[1] }}</span>
        <span class="pdx__assuresub">{{ bits[2] }}</span>
      </span>
    </li>
  {%- endfor -%}
</ul>
